      "source": [
        "# Duck-typing\n",
        "\n",
        "Duck typing relies on an object's supported behavior rather than its declared type. For example, code can accept any object with a suitable `read()` method.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-duck-typing)"
      ]
    }
